A move leaves the last node below the source linking up to the emptied slot,
so the children of the moved capability lead into a slot that holds nothing.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work test smp-test qemu-replay
Report: link up to a slot that is not a live, filled one

diff --git a/kernel/cap.c b/kernel/cap.c
--- a/kernel/cap.c
+++ b/kernel/cap.c
@@ -132,9 +132,6 @@ void cap_move(struct cap *from, struct cap *to)
             pred->next = v2p(to);
         }
     }
-    if (from->child != 0) {
-        node(node(from->child)->prev)->next = v2p(to) | LINK_UP;
-    }
     *from = (struct cap){ 0 };
 }
 
